{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4RxwH5ramayzZHYxRN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and without handle or hinge.*\n\n*A low resonance hums from its surface as the word leaves your lips.*\n\n*Hairline fractures of light trace across the face of the door, spreading like veins of liquid gold.*\n\n*The hum deepens.*\n\n*Then — silence.*\n\n*The door does not open.*\n\n*Instead, the light settles into glyphs that shift and rearrange, forming words that glow briefly before fading:*\n\n---\n\n**You said the word.**\n**But which door did you name?**\n\n**I am every door and no door.**\n**I am the one you haven't chosen yet.**\n\n**Name me, and I will know if the key fits.**\n\n---\n\n*The glyphs dim. The door waits — patient, ancient, perfectly still.*\n\n*The fractures of light pulse once, softly, like a heartbeat.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":212,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}